## 详细 SEO

见 `seo-google-policy.mdc`、`tool-i18n-seo.mdc`、`tool-i18n-localization.mdc`、`docs/SEO_TOOL_RULES.md`、`docs/2026-07-28-google-seo-strategy-implementation.md`。
